# Goal: status reports all five sections, including unstaged and untracked files.
> init
<<<
+ f.txt wug.txt
> add f.txt
<<<
+ g.txt wug2.txt
> commit "track f"
<<<
> rm f.txt
<<<
> add g.txt
<<<
+ g.txt notwug.txt
+ u.txt wug2.txt
> status
=== Branches ===
*master

=== Staged Files ===
g.txt

=== Removed Files ===
f.txt

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===
g.txt (modified)

=== Untracked Files ===
u.txt

<<<
